/P 499 0 R
/T (During my work on the web application, I applied knowledge I gained in school, such as information retrieval, structured data handling, and systems/prompt engineering. Since it's my first time working with RAG, building a RAG pipeline that extracts ATA codes from manuals for aircraft engineers was quite a refreshing feeling. I think did well in integrating multiple PDFs, improving retrieval accuracy, and building the pipeline in general. )
/E (During my work on the web application, I applied knowledge I gained in school, such as information retrieval, structured data handling, and systems/prompt engineering. Since it's my first time working with RAG, building a RAG pipeline that extracts ATA codes from manuals for aircraft engineers was quite a refreshing feeling. I think did well in integrating multiple PDFs, improving retrieval accuracy, and building the pipeline in general. )
/Pg 63 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
